# What never belongs in an image build context. All four images take the
# repository root as their context, so one file covers them.
#
# cargo writes idle/target on a workstation, and it holds gigabytes that no
# build inside an image reads: the image compiles the crate again on its own
# pinned toolchain.
idle/target/

# The documentation site and its theme. The idle image reads the crate and the
# two brand files its Dockerfile names, and nothing in any image serves a page.
docs/public/
docs/resources/
docs/themes/brand/.git

# The Go coverage profile the gate writes on every run.
coverage.out

# cargo writes a target tree in the brand submodule's crate too, when a
# workstation builds that crate in place, and it grows to gigabytes the
# idle image never reads.
docs/themes/brand/iced/target/

# Build outputs at the root: the operator binary a workstation build
# writes, and the rendered documentation site.
/media-operator
docs/dist/
